
Creates a new instance and sets the property values for the new instance.
USAGE:

CREATE <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

NOTE: Create cannot be used to create a new class.

The following properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
ConnectionlessService              	N/A                 	N/A       
Description                        	N/A                 	N/A       
GuaranteesDelivery                 	N/A                 	N/A       
GuaranteesSequencing               	N/A                 	N/A       
InstallDate                        	N/A                 	N/A       
MaximumAddressSize                 	N/A                 	N/A       
MaximumMessageSize                 	N/A                 	N/A       
MessageOriented                    	N/A                 	N/A       
MinimumAddressSize                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Name                               	N/A                 	N/A       
PseudoStreamOriented               	N/A                 	N/A       
Status                             	N/A                 	N/A       
SupportsBroadcasting               	N/A                 	N/A       
SupportsConnectData                	N/A                 	N/A       
SupportsDisconnectData             	N/A                 	N/A       
SupportsEncryption                 	N/A                 	N/A       
SupportsExpeditedData              	N/A                 	N/A       
SupportsFragmentation              	N/A                 	N/A       
SupportsGracefulClosing            	N/A                 	N/A       
SupportsGuaranteedBandwidth        	N/A                 	N/A       
SupportsMulticasting               	N/A                 	N/A       
SupportsQualityofService           	N/A                 	N/A       

